#  ***************************************************************************
#  Regression test for the 10-node-tet nodal projection (GitHub issue #12).
#  A composite Tet<10> cube is projected with "Project IP to Nodal Field".
#
#  The sharp regression signal is proj_nodal_linear: the built-in linear
#  field 1.5*x - 0.8*y + 1.1*z, which a correct linear Tet<4> down-cast
#  projection recovers to machine precision at every node. It is checked
#  ABSOLUTE at 1e-10 -- a broken projection is off by O(0.1-1), so this
#  catches any regression while being build-independent. The projected and
#  raw Cauchy stress are checked relative to guard the projected values and
#  the solve.
#  ***************************************************************************

COORDINATES absolute 1.e-6

TIME STEPS relative 1.e-6 floor 0.0

NODAL VARIABLES relative 1.0e-5 floor 1.0e-9
	proj_nodal_linear   absolute 1.0e-10

ELEMENT VARIABLES relative 1.0e-5 floor 1.0e-8
